  m_text: 'Arrange real upright trailers during setup. Steering slides the selected
    piece sideways, throttle changes its spacing; tap ACTION with centered controls
    to select the next piece, or hold ACTION and steer to rotate it. Invalid overlapping
    placements are refused. After the horn, ACTION gives only the first trailer one
    physical push; collisions must carry the chain. Longest Chain ranks genuine connected
    chain depth. Precision rewards propagated topples close to the authored course
    line. Fastest Complete Collapse scores only a complete chain and ranks actual
    collapse time. Creative Chain is a cooperative workshop: real branches and direction
    changes add team craft points, without individual winner points. A trailer that
    falls without contact from the triggered chain does not score.'
